			<Item class="Script" referent="RBX308">
				<Properties>
					<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
					<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
					<string name="Name">README</string>
					<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[ Ok, here is the Iron Man 2 &apos;Suit&apos;case (lol I maded a pun)
Instructions:
Read this README 
Everything that is inside of &apos;PUT IN LIGHTING&apos;, take it out and put in Lighting
Everything that is inside of &apos;PUT IN STARTERPACK&apos;, take it out and put in the StarterPack
I added VIP stuff so if you use Person299&apos;s Admin Commands you can just say give/me/VIPSuitcase and have the upgraded suitcase
I will regularly update this so be prepared to take out the old version from your place and put in the new version
Make sure you credit RockJumper111 because I spent a while working on this
Press Q for Iron Man and E for WarMachine
I might ad other suits like the MK 1 and stuff, so yeah
have fun! ]]--</ProtectedString>
					<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
				</Properties>
				<Item class="Script" referent="RBX309">
					<Properties>
						<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
						<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
						<string name="Name">IronMan</string>
						<ProtectedString name="Source">wait(10)
local h = Instance.new(&quot;Hint&quot;)
h.Parent = game.Workspace
h.Text = (&quot;(Credits to RockJumper111 for the &apos;Suit&apos;case)&quot;)
end </ProtectedString>
						<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
			</Item>
